We trained our model on a single RTX 3090 GPU with 24GB of memory. The AdamW optimizer (Loshchilov and Hutter, 2019) was employed with a learning rate of $5 \times 10^{-5}$ . We utilized the pretrained checkpoint of the RoBERTa (Liu et al., 2019) base model and its pre-trained tokenizer, avoiding the use of any custom vocabulary. To facilitate larger batch sizes, we implemented gradient accumulation. The same hyperparameters were applied for both KidLM and KidLM+ models.

Table 7: Our probe query templates designed for qualitatively measure preference autocompletion categorized into diverse groups such as Preferences, Emotions and Feelings, and Wishes and Desires.   

<table><tr><td>Type</td><td>Probe Query</td></tr><tr><td>Preferences</td><td>&quot;My favorite food is [MASK].&quot; 
&quot;I love playing [MASK].&quot; 
&quot;My favorite person is my [MASK].&quot; 
&quot;On weekends, I like to [MASK].&quot; 
&quot;I like stories about [MASK].&quot;</td></tr><tr><td>Emotions and Feelings</td><td>&quot;I am scared of [MASK].&quot; 
&quot;I feel happiest when I [MASK].&quot;</td></tr><tr><td>Wishes and Desires</td><td>&quot;On my birthday, I want [MASK].&quot; 
&quot;I wish I could improve my skill at [MASK].&quot; 
&quot;It&#x27;s my dream to own a [MASK] one day.&quot; 
&quot;I&#x27;d like to get a [MASK] for my birthday.&quot;</td></tr></table>

Detailed hyperparameter settings are presented in Table 8.

Table 8: Our KidLM models hyperparameter settings.   

<table><tr><td>Hyperparameter</td><td>KidLM</td><td>KidLM+</td></tr><tr><td>Learning Rate</td><td>5 × 10-5</td><td>5 × 10-5</td></tr><tr><td>Batch Size</td><td>64</td><td>64</td></tr><tr><td>Sequence Length</td><td>128</td><td>128</td></tr><tr><td>Learning Rate Schedule</td><td>Cosine</td><td>Cosine</td></tr><tr><td>Optimizer</td><td>AdamW</td><td>AdamW</td></tr><tr><td>Warmup Proportion</td><td>10%</td><td>10%</td></tr><tr><td>Training Epochs</td><td>200</td><td>200</td></tr><tr><td>Architecture</td><td>RoBERTa (base)</td><td>RoBERTa (base)</td></tr></table>

